{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/1.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The earth has entered another ice age. Humans have abandoned the planet. Over time, those who would inherit the world are... rabbits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This civilization of highly evolved of rabbits took to the task of reclaiming human technology in the ruins known as &quot;Smokestack Mountain&quot;. This fluffy society has long refered to humans as &quot;giants&quot; from the past and think the book Peter Rabbit is the Bible. Those fearless enough to explore this vast unknown are called &quot;rust diggers.&quot; Our protagonist, an old rabbit named Stamp, is one such rust digger, making his living by excavating and exploring for a profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, on his way back from an excavation under Smokestack Mountain, our hero- a rabbit called Stamp, encounters a rust digging team known as the &quot;BBs&quot; and joins them in a quest to delve deeper into the mysterious riches of Smokestack Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way he discovers information about his estranged daughter, hinting at her peril and revealing hidden truths about the world he once believed in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/2.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A middle-aged, grumpy and impatient rabbit, obsessed with collecting junk and tinkering with machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/3.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During this adventure, Stamp will meet many friendly, fluffy and adorabe villagers, who will help him on his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/4.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/5.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With your mech's ninja-like speed and mobility, explore the ruins by smashing through blocks, and loot any treasure that awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/6.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/7.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various weapons and abilities are at your command to navigate dungeons and take on enemies. Power up as you collect junk and discover new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/8.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/9.png?t=1744815626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your mech with parts and materials collected from the ruins! Level up Stamp's abilities as you battle various foes and baosses to reclaim hidden treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/extras/10.png?t=1744815626\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Legendary Rust-Grubber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/ef3b36ca1ae0ac35adc5b692d5231d7a4d78e054.jpg"},{"name":"The D-TAM Database","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/bcac2d062470c10dc7a2f1c31802e35f0ba5f0c1.jpg"},{"name":"Traces of My Daughter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/ce8219ea771d35eb9bd1d765021165c841d54595.jpg"},{"name":"Attack!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/c3711723aeb3bdbe36e290ccaf45d8c181d5e5a9.jpg"},{"name":"Record of Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/27433f2b648a051af5ef54bc2e178f9aaa7126c9.jpg"},{"name":"Past To Present","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/b94d8ff78b245ea8bd505ed4b8ed43cc96434f9d.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Junk Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/5633bf8e8aec29984815e080c6eea1a4df25f7bb.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Junk Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/9a0cbe1e7a7cbecaa57b5113024cd416ea93116a.jpg"},{"name":"Master Junk Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/d544e8c13562cb2819fb4ce94bac8aef53c912bb.jpg"},{"name":"Your Partner's Weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530560/bf27161c6fd4e1e746ca22c13986b24ffc7ed0d8.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530560?t=1744815626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744815626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/81dcc95421ef7341a37e56eb1aa8ebc26c178124/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744815626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama